exists su name stream stdout ob bool truth be default ya
su name talk loop fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
  su name prompt ob text "Speak now. Say \"bye\" to stop. Press Ctrl+D when done." be write do
  su name transcript be hear vyah stream do
  su name transcript out ob name transcript be write do
  su name mind be mind accordingto name "Reply in one short sentence." ya
  su name mind-out ob name transcript for name mind to name text mind-out be write do
  su name draft out ob name mind-out be write do
  su name audio ob name mind-out to filename "artifacts/say/talk-loop-stream.wav" be say do
  ob name transcript be equally from text "bye" then this fromindex num 0 ret
  ob name transcript be equally from text "bye." then this fromindex num 0 ret
  ob name transcript be equally from text "bye!" then this fromindex num 0 ret
  this ret
prah
fromindex num 10 toindex num 0 be talk loop do
